@startuml 07-storage-class
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title PortCloak — Storage Backends & Transfer Contracts

interface BlobStore {
  +Stat(ctx, key): ObjectInfo
  +Put(ctx, key, r, opts): PutResult
  +Get(ctx, key, w, opts): GetResult
  +List(ctx, prefix): []ObjectInfo
  +Delete(ctx, key): error
  +InitMultipart(ctx, key): UploadID
  +PutPart(ctx, id, n, r): PartETag
  +CompleteMultipart(ctx, id, parts): PutResult
  +AbortMultipart(ctx, id): error
}

interface ResumableTransfer {
  +Resume(ctx, checkpoint): Progress
  +Checkpoint(): TransferState
}

class DiskStore
class SftpStore
class S3Store
class AzureBlobStore

BlobStore <|.. DiskStore
BlobStore <|.. SftpStore
BlobStore <|.. S3Store
BlobStore <|.. AzureBlobStore

ResumableTransfer <|.. S3Store
ResumableTransfer <|.. AzureBlobStore
ResumableTransfer <|.. SftpStore

class RetryPolicy {
  +maxAttempts: int
  +baseDelay / maxDelay: dur
  +jitter: bool
  +retryable(err): bool
}

class CircuitBreaker {
  +state: enum(closed|open|half-open)
  +failureThreshold: int
  +cooldown: dur
}

DiskStore ..> RetryPolicy
SftpStore ..> RetryPolicy
S3Store ..> RetryPolicy
AzureBlobStore ..> RetryPolicy
SftpStore ..> CircuitBreaker
S3Store ..> CircuitBreaker
AzureBlobStore ..> CircuitBreaker

note bottom of S3Store
  Multipart upload => native resume.
  Server-side + client-side checksums.
  Works with AWS S3 and MinIO.
end note

note bottom of AzureBlobStore
  Block blobs (Put Block / Put Block List)
  => resumable. Targets Azurite emulator
  and real Azure Blob.
end note

@enduml
